# GYAM Homelab Deploy

- Authoritative runbook: `docs/homelab.md`.
- **Phase A:** TrueNAS SCALE Custom App — Postgres unpublished + single app container LAN `:4070`.
- **Phase B (later):** Cloudflare Tunnel → one HTTPS origin; optional nginx; `COOKIE_SECURE=true`.
- Local Compose Postgres (`5434`) is **dev only**; do not publish DB on TrueNAS.
- One API origin serves web / PWA / future desktop wrapper (SPA from Express in prod image).
- Keep secrets in env; document required vars without real values.
- Prefer healthchecks (Node `fetch` for app) and ZFS datasets under `appPool/gyam`.
- Do not require Tailscale/Nextcloud; do not treat WAN as done until Tunnel is live.
- Sidecars are optional — do not block core bring-up.
- Private GHCR pulls need a PAT; commit Prisma migrations before `migrate deploy` on homelab.
